<div class="pw-functional-area"><div>
    <div class="pw-container" pw-disclaimer-modal style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="pw-w-8/12 pw-m-auto">
            <gds-card-pw variant="neutral-02-outlined">
                <gds-text-pw tag="h2">Disclaimer</gds-text-pw>
                <div>

<h3>Skandinaviska Enskilda Banken</h3>
<p><strong>Please read carefully the following terms and conditions. By accessing this site and the information contained herein, you agree to be bound by the terms and conditions below. If you do not agree to these terms and conditions, do not access this site or any of the information contained herein.</strong></p>
<h4>No offer or solicitation</h4>
<p>Neither this site nor anything contained herein shall constitute financial, legal, tax or other advice or an invitation or recommendation to invest or otherwise deal in, or an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy or subscribe for, any security. There shall be no sale of any securities in any jurisdiction in which such an offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful prior to qualification under the securities laws of such state or jurisdiction. Any products or services mentioned herein shall only be available subject to local legal and regulatory requirements. Professional advice should be sought prior to any decision to invest in the securities.</p>
<h4>Use of information</h4>
<p>The information and data contained herein is confidential and is intended solely for your personal use benefit and for your internal informational use only and may not be reproduced, disseminated or distributed in whole or in part at any time, in any manner or for any purpose, without obtaining the prior written consent of Skandinaviska Enskilda Banken in each specific instance.</p>
<h4>Legal considerations</h4>
<p>Nothing in this site constitutes an offer of securities for sale in the United States or any other jurisdiction. The Securities may not be offered or sold in the United States absent registration or an exemption from registration under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the Securities Act). It is not intended that the Securities will be registered under the Securities Act or any U.S. state securities laws or the laws of any other jurisdiction.</p>
<p>Persons accessing this site are deemed to represent that they are either (i) not a U.S. person (within the meaning of Regulation S) or acting for the account or benefit of a U.S. person and the person accessing this site is not located in the United States, its territories and possessions (including Puerto Rico, the U.S. Virgin Islands, Guam, American Samoa, Wake Island and the Northern Mariana Islands) or the District of Columbia or (ii) a qualified institutional buyer in reliance upon Rule 144A under the Securities Act and if you are a person in the United Kingdom, then you are a person who (i) has professional experience in matters relating to investments and who falls within Article 19(5) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (Financial Promotion) Order 2005, as amended (the Order) and/or (ii) is a high net worth entity or other person falling within Article 49(2)(a) to (e) of the Order.</p>
<p>The distribution of the offering documents on this site may be restricted by local law in jurisdictions other than the United States and failure to comply with such restrictions may constitute a violation of the laws of any such other jurisdiction. Persons accessing this site should inform themselves about, and observe any such restrictions. In particular, no information contained in this site is for distribution directly or indirectly in Australia, Japan or the United Kingdom unless in circumstances in which Section 21(1) of the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 (as amended) do not apply.</p>
<p>This website and the offering documents available for viewing are informative in nature and do not constitute an offer of securities to the public as defined in Regulation (EU) 2017/1129 nor make such an offer.</p>
<h4>No liability</h4>
<p>The material on this site has no regard to the specific investment objectives, financial situation or particular needs of any recipient. The information in each of the offering documents is historical in nature and should not be relied on when making any investment decision. No representation or warranty, express or implied, is or will be made in relation to, the accuracy or completeness of the information on this site. No liability whatsoever is or will be accepted by Skandinaviska Enskilda Banken for any loss or damage howsoever arising from any use of this site or its contents.</p>
<h4>Investment considerations</h4>
<p>The securities offered under each of the offering documents are available only to persons having experience in matters relating to investments. Persons who do not have professional experience in matters relating to investments should not access this site.</p>
<p>You should read the entire offering documents related to an offering of securities before you purchase any such securities.</p>
<p>Prospective investors should consult their own financial and legal advisors about risks associated with investment in a particular issue of securities and the suitability of investing in such securities in light of their particular circumstances.</p>
<p>The offering document relating to each offering of Securities is accurate as of the date thereof but may not be accurate as of any subsequent date, and the information contained therein speaks only as of the date of such offering document. Skandinaviska Enskilda Banken has undertaken no obligation, and has assumed no responsibility, to update the information contained in any of the offering documents on this Website for facts or events arising after completion of the related offering documents delivery period for such offering documents.</p>
<p><strong>I acknowledge and confirm that I have read, understand and accept the above terms and conditions.</strong></p>
</div>
                <gds-flex-pw gap="m" justify-content="end">
                    <gds-button-pw href="/" rank="secondary">Decline</gds-button-pw>
                    <gds-button-pw id="disclaimer_accept" rank="primary" type="submit">Accept</gds-button-pw>
                </gds-flex-pw>
            </gds-card-pw>
        </div>
    </div>
</div></div>

    

